{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7b2a9d10-4c11-4f82-9e52-8d1a2c3e4f50",
    "name": "Catalog Service — Plataforma de Gestión Car Wash",
    "description": "Colección oficial de pruebas HTTP para el microservicio Catalog Service (Ingeniería Web III).\n\nRecorrido recomendado:\n1. Health -> Comprobar que Catalog está activo.\n2. Administración -> Crear servicio, actualizar datos, cambiar precio, desactivar, consultar desde admin y reactivar.\n3. Servicios públicos -> Listar servicios activos y consultar por UUID.\n4. Consulta por lote -> Verificar respuesta para Wash Order (incluyendo inactivos y notFound).\n5. Casos de error -> Verificar validaciones 400, 401/403, 404 y 409.\n\nNota sobre autenticación administrativa (/api/catalog/admin/*):\nMientras Identity Service y API Gateway no estén integrados, no existe un token JWT real. Para ejecutar las solicitudes administrativas con rol ADMIN, inicia Catalog Service con `npm run dev:admin` (o `DEV_AUTH_ROLE=ADMIN`). Para comprobar 401 UNAUTHORIZED inicia con `npm start`, y para 403 FORBIDDEN con `DEV_AUTH_ROLE=OPERATOR`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3002",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "serviceId",
      "value": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "missingId",
      "value": "99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "serviceName",
      "value": "TEST - Lavado Integral",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Verificación de disponibilidad del microservicio Catalog Service.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. GET /health — Estado del servicio",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica que el microservicio Catalog Service esté en ejecución y responda 200 OK."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200 OK y formato JSON', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.response.to.be.json;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Incluye status ok y service catalog-service', function () {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.service).to.eql('catalog-service');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.timestamp).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Administración",
      "description": "Operaciones administrativas del catálogo (`/api/catalog/admin/services`). Requiere iniciar el servicio con `DEV_AUTH_ROLE=ADMIN` (`npm run dev:admin`) mientras Identity Service y API Gateway no estén integrados.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2. POST /api/catalog/admin/services — Crear servicio",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const uniqueSuffix = Date.now().toString().slice(-6);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('serviceName', 'TEST - Lavado Integral ' + uniqueSuffix);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 201 Created y JSON válido', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "  pm.response.to.be.json;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve servicio con UUID válido, campos obligatorios y guarda serviceId', function () {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.id).to.match(/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.name).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('serviceName'));",
                  "  pm.expect(body.price).to.eql(80.5);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.currency).to.eql('BOB');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.estimatedDuration).to.eql(45);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.isActive).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.version).to.eql(1);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('serviceId', body.id);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{serviceName}}\",\n  \"description\": \"Servicio de prueba: lavado exterior, interior y aspirado\",\n  \"price\": 80.50,\n  \"currency\": \"BOB\",\n  \"estimatedDuration\": 45\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/admin/services",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "catalog", "admin", "services"]
            },
            "description": "Crea un servicio nuevo en el catálogo y almacena su UUID en la variable de colección `serviceId`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. GET /api/catalog/admin/services — Listar todos (activos e inactivos)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200 OK y JSON válido', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.response.to.be.json;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Incluye items, total, page y pageSize', function () {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.items).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.total).to.be.a('number');",
